[thin] These are the 2 mm walls at either side of the beverage outlet. The passages guide the separate LLDPE tubes through the open outlet; fluid pressure is contained by the tubes. The mesh thickness matches the specified 2 mm skin. Physical threading and edge finish remain unmeasured for this regenerated tip.
alternatives: More outside stock changes the matching cover and outlet envelope. More inside stock reduces tube clearance. Moving the outlets changes the symmetric beverage locations and display clearance.
