[thin] These picks surround the display pocket and its rear rim. The saved mesh reports 2.220–2.221 mm at the side boundaries and 2.952 mm at the small outer rim. The pocket follows the component insertion envelope and leaves its underside open over the tube paths. Physical component fit remains scoped to the identified articles, not this regenerated tip.
alternatives: Filling inward uses display insertion clearance. Growing the outside requires a larger matching cover and changes its retention fit. Moving the pocket changes its tube, ribbon and component clearances.
